       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed it (Order ID ORD-0001): amlodipine 50 mg by mouth, once daily.\n\nI added a note to the order. It says the dose is above the usual 10 mg/day maximum, that it was flagged at entry, and that you confirmed it. The note also recommends pharmacist verification and close blood pressure and heart rate monitoring.\n\nAmlodipine has a long half-life of about 30 to 50 hours, so it accumulates with daily dosing. Hypotension can come on late and last a long time. Frequent vitals are worth ordering. I can't tell whether the order system will alert pharmacy to the dose, so you may want to contact them directly."
